      "section_id": "personality",
      "section_title": "Personality",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "Q1",
          "text": "When working on a group project, you naturally tend to:",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Take the lead and organize tasks"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Support others and keep the team motivated"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Focus on details and quality of work"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Generate ideas and think outside the box"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q2",
          "text": "Which of these excites you the most?",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Solving a tricky math or logic puzzle"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Creating something artistic (drawing, writing, music)"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Helping a friend solve a personal problem"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Organizing an event or activity"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q3",
          "text": "When faced with a new challenge, you usually:",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Plan carefully before acting"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Jump in and learn as you go"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Ask others for advice first"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Research thoroughly before deciding"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q4",
          "text": "What kind of subjects do you enjoy most in school?",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Maths/Physics (logic, numbers)"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Biology/Chemistry (life sciences)"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Languages/Social Studies (people, communication)"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Computers/Arts (creativity, design)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q5",
          "text": "How do you usually react under pressure (exams, deadlines)?",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "I stay calm and work through it systematically"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "I get anxious but push through anyway"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "I seek help/support from others"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "I thrive — pressure motivates me"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q6",
          "text": "What kind of recognition matters most to you?",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Academic excellence/top marks"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Being known as creative/talented"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Being seen as helpful/dependable"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Being seen as a leader/organizer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "Q7",
          "text": "If you had a free day with no obligations, you'd most likely:",
          "options": [
            {
              "key": "a",
              "text": "Read, study, or learn something new"
            },
            {
              "key": "b",
              "text": "Work on a creative hobby"
            },
            {
              "key": "c",
              "text": "Spend time with friends/family"
            },
            {
              "key": "d",
              "text": "Plan or organize something (an event, a trip, a project)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
